    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f30b4664fdbdc10b5ccc4da3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——埋葬“断绝”。这是某种行为吗？\r\n这行为又有怎样的意义呢？\r\n我无法理解这些话语的含义。但……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0931cdb30a4aa5c358f9e96317cd16498e943dfec85e7aaf4742ab92e2b2086a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdeab0ecdc5eeb67108bcb2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看起来，这位少女似乎并不会对周围造成什么危害。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccbbfdf1c0cf92767322deb8a3ae3c223eceb53c5f5f41a57e10e51c23e6a9a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d8c3462bfe4a5e036181ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对，我是个训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4e9085202c6573d1f9fbd03206c28e01f5884b03b4d1994507115b217c6275",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a015ca7e1b5f019676dd9247",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是训练员哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0dba1b0d3e6c12f63acda9bf66a067fb30586fbc49d2aa1f2b912e6a457130",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c1a7538e8aaa007b7c8a7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
