    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ea9d94457945710a1c3717",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "您的职责是……“养成者”。\r\n『训练员』……是这么说的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca94223f457c351cf523161ca306ba9a9787a64d19890871946166569d723f81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6340a750ca88531716ccd534",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我还没能找到签约赛马娘，\r\n但我姑且也还算是个训练员……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4168b5c7638849c5a01a597c61d0c831bdb8fb0974bed85fd577dec1c64ca480",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
