    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4caf41e2de143c849ea8b7f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我正身处深夜的特雷森学园。\r\n先前因为工作的事情而在教学楼里多留了一会儿……\r\n现在，我居然听见头顶传来奇妙的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc7bf5f574de21a3a13a3a7f48a53c8c68938c9512b7993716ea3da342ba0d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
