    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6443574796b7a60778cf762",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……首先得“具现”。\r\n完成“可视”之事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "374144c81dbdf0c379ae9bdde7ec8e9246fdb1099faa2dd525ec9f1c3487710d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653a542a5aa470f8db916c1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbedf5dd941362200c28d237",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是不这么做……便无法“乘上轨道”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8306017550da7d88c737ffe2489d325d4d027152e545aecda7146e15820437f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:528b48658ca5a69e852efa8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙抬头仰望夜空。\r\n我循着她的目光也抬头看去——\r\n但夜空中除了浩瀚群星之外再无他物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31298d5ec0f497be5170ca383d7ce0928860f2259d84a9d54e022f75f5af5aed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03b69b2a34a24cffd8a594bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——但当我再度看向她时……\r\n她却已经消失了。\r\n简直……就像消融于时空的界限之中了一般。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d185349fc5df16666b38fcac9d96acebe024f2c715eb74f482996695feace3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcbf84f0dc497075cca8b435",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“新宇宙”……那日我所见的少女，真的存在吗？\r\n还是说，我所见的不过是飘渺的虚像？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b140cf7e8b1c480e504eb7147caba8f954b9981ed7624fa130d66a57f036dc15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1105/storytimeline_041105001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:391855906f741ed975f6e484",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "※システム上のです。",
