    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4132279ae3c9acbc2951849",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在比赛中没有做出过任何多余的动作，这水平实在难得。\r\n新宇宙的智力水平，也许远超我的想象……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b4eded96f112e31e7093e520b1fbc29786d29e1d49aebd191046fc70432d94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
